    description: "Kritisch-Watten (also known as Bayerisch Watten or Kritisch Warp) is a popular Alpine variant of the trick-taking game Watten, widely played in Bavaria, Tyrol (Austria), and South Tyrol. It is distinguished by the presence of 'Kritische Karten' (Criticals or Kritten)â€”permanent trumps that rank above all other cards, including the elected trump suit and rank. The game is highly social, utilizing secret signals between partners and psychological bluffing.",
